#: ../../content/index.md:5
msgid "Welcome to the Resthome documentation"
msgstr "Bienvenue dans la documentation Resthome"

#: ../../content/index.md:8
msgid ""
"User documentation for Resthome, the software for nursing and care homes "
"built on Odoo: residents, admissions, care and medicines, meals, billing, "
"the family portal, staff planning and quality, with a space for each "
"country's rules."
msgstr ""
"Documentation utilisateur de Resthome, le logiciel pour maisons de repos et "
"de soins bâti sur Odoo : habitants, admissions, soins et médicaments, repas,"
" facturation, portail famille, planning du personnel et qualité, avec un "
"espace pour les règles de chaque pays."

#: ../../content/index.md:11
msgid ""
"**Resthome** is the **WideCare** suite for **nursing and care homes**, "
"published by LPLG **on Odoo**: residents, admissions, care and medicines, "
"meals, billing, the family portal, staff planning and quality, all in one "
"place. This documentation guides you day by day, step by step, with "
"screenshots."
msgstr ""
"**Resthome** est la suite **WideCare** pour les **maisons de repos et de "
"soins**, éditée par LPLG **sur Odoo** : habitants, admissions, soins et "
"médicaments, repas, facturation, portail famille, planning du personnel et "
"qualité, le tout au même endroit. Cette documentation vous accompagne au "
"quotidien, étape par étape, avec des captures d'écran."

#: ../../content/index.md:16
msgid ""
"The pages below apply in every country. What comes from a country's own "
"rules — its dependency scale, its health insurers, its electronic exchanges,"
" its funding — lives in that country's space."
msgstr ""
"Les pages ci-dessous s'appliquent dans tous les pays. Ce qui découle des "
"règles propres à un pays — son échelle de dépendance, ses assureurs santé, "
"ses échanges électroniques, son financement — se trouve dans l'espace de ce "
"pays."

#: ../../content/index.md:20
msgid "Your country"
msgstr "Votre pays"

#: ../../content/index.md:22
msgid ""
"Each country has its own space. The **country selector** at the top of the "
"page filters the navigation: the side bar shows the common applications and "
"the space of the country you choose."
msgstr ""
"Chaque pays a son propre espace. Le **sélecteur de pays** en haut de la page"
" filtre la navigation : la barre latérale affiche les applications communes "
"et l'espace du pays choisi."

#: ../../content/index.md:34
msgid ""
"The Belgian dependency scale, the allowance paid by the health insurers, the"
" electronic exchanges with them, the institutional allowance, the day care "
"centre and serviced residences."
msgstr ""
"L'échelle de dépendance belge, le forfait payé par les mutuelles, les "
"échanges électroniques avec elles, le forfait institutionnel, le centre de "
"soins de jour et les résidences-services."

#: ../../content/index.md:41 ../../content/index.md:48
#: ../../content/index.md:55 ../../content/index.md:62
msgid "Coming soon."
msgstr "Bientôt disponible."

#: ../../content/index.md:66
msgid "The applications"
msgstr "Les applications"

#: ../../content/index.md:76
msgid ""
"Log in, discover the apps and the dashboard, and find your way around a "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"Se connecter, découvrir les applications et le tableau de bord, et se "
"repérer dans un écran."

#: ../../content/index.md:79
msgid "Residents"
msgstr "Habitants"

#: ../../content/index.md:83
msgid ""
"The resident's file, the stay, the assessments, the rooms and the condition "
"report."
msgstr ""
"Le dossier de l'habitant, le séjour, les évaluations, les chambres et l'état"
" des lieux."

#: ../../content/index.md:86
msgid "Admissions"
msgstr "Admissions"

#: ../../content/index.md:90
msgid ""
"From the first enquiry to the move-in: the pipeline, the candidate's file, "
"the admission."
msgstr ""
"De la première demande à l'emménagement : le pipeline, le dossier du "
"candidat, l'admission."

#: ../../content/index.md:93
msgid "Serviced residences"
msgstr "Résidences-services"

#: ../../content/index.md:97
msgid ""
"Units, regimes and contracts of a serviced residence: notice, billing, "
"meals, calls and requests."
msgstr ""
"Logements, régimes et contrats d'une résidence-services : préavis, "
"facturation, repas, appels et demandes."

#: ../../content/index.md:100
msgid "Care"
msgstr "Soins"

#: ../../content/index.md:104
msgid ""
"The care dashboard, the clinical record, care plans and tasks, observations,"
" assessments and registers."
msgstr ""
"Le tableau de bord des soins, le dossier clinique, les plans et tâches de "
"soins, les observations, les évaluations et les registres."

#: ../../content/index.md:107
msgid "Medicines"
msgstr "Médicaments"

#: ../../content/index.md:111
msgid ""
"The medication circuit on one screen: prescriptions, treatments, pharmacy "
"orders, pillboxes, the round and the follow-up."
msgstr ""
"Le circuit du médicament sur un seul écran : ordonnances, traitements, "
"commandes à la pharmacie, piluliers, le tour et le suivi."

#: ../../content/index.md:114
msgid "WideCare app"
msgstr "App WideCare"

#: ../../content/index.md:118
msgid ""
"The day's work of the staff on a phone or tablet: tasks, medication round, "
"residents, observations, meals, drinks and rooms."
msgstr ""
"Le travail du jour du personnel sur téléphone ou tablette : tâches, tour des"
" médicaments, habitants, observations, repas, boissons et chambres."

#: ../../content/index.md:121
msgid "Meals"
msgstr "Repas"

#: ../../content/index.md:125
msgid ""
"Menus and diets, dishes and textures, meal distribution, nutrition "
"monitoring and the public menu."
msgstr ""
"Menus et régimes, plats et textures, distribution des repas, suivi "
"nutritionnel et menu public."

#: ../../content/index.md:128
msgid "Billing"
msgstr "Facturation"

#: ../../content/index.md:132
msgid ""
"Billing periods, the invoice type, the care allowance, supplements, absences"
" and invoices."
msgstr ""
"Périodes de facturation, type de facture, forfait de soins, suppléments, "
"absences et factures."

#: ../../content/index.md:135
msgid "Split billing"
msgstr "Facturation partagée"

#: ../../content/index.md:139
msgid "The resident's share divided among several debtors, one invoice each."
msgstr ""
"La part habitant répartie entre plusieurs débiteurs, une facture chacun."

#: ../../content/index.md:142
msgid "Pocket money"
msgstr "Argent de poche"

#: ../../content/index.md:146
msgid ""
"The money the home holds for a resident: balance, purchases and settlement."
msgstr ""
"L'argent que la maison détient pour un habitant : solde, achats et "
"règlement."

#: ../../content/index.md:149
msgid "Family portal"
msgstr "Portail famille"

#: ../../content/index.md:153
msgid ""
"What relatives may see: liaison notebook, documents, invoices, health "
"summary."
msgstr ""
"Ce que les proches peuvent voir : carnet de liaison, documents, factures, "
"résumé de santé."

#: ../../content/index.md:156
msgid "Resident documents"
msgstr "Documents de l'habitant"

#: ../../content/index.md:160
msgid "Automatic document folders per resident and attachment centralization."
msgstr ""
"Dossiers documentaires automatiques par habitant et centralisation des "
"pièces jointes."

#: ../../content/index.md:163
msgid "Technical interventions"
msgstr "Interventions techniques"

#: ../../content/index.md:167
msgid ""
"Repairs in the residents' rooms: the ticket, its full cost, and billing it "
"to the resident."
msgstr ""
"Les réparations dans les chambres des habitants : le ticket, son coût "
"complet, et sa facturation à l'habitant."

#: ../../content/index.md:170
msgid "Staff planning"
msgstr "Planning du personnel"

#: ../../content/index.md:174
msgid ""
"Shifts by role and sector, critical periods, automatic planning and the "
"schedule sent to the staff."
msgstr ""
"Les postes par rôle et par secteur, les périodes critiques, la planification"
" automatique et l'horaire envoyé au personnel."

#: ../../content/index.md:177
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "Qualité"

#: ../../content/index.md:181
msgid ""
"The complaints register, the residents' council and the observation of "
"preserved capacities."
msgstr ""
"Le registre des plaintes, le conseil des habitants et l'observation des "
"capacités préservées."

#: ../../content/index.md:184
msgid "WideCare AI assistant"
msgstr "Assistant IA WideCare"

#: ../../content/index.md:188
msgid "Ask the documentation a question without leaving Resthome."
msgstr "Posez une question à la documentation sans quitter Resthome."

#: ../../content/index.md:191
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: ../../content/index.md:195
msgid "All the settings: residents, billing, meals and documents."
msgstr "Tous les réglages : habitants, facturation, repas et documents."

#: ../../content/index.md:199
msgid "A precise question?"
msgstr "Une question précise ?"

#: ../../content/index.md:202
msgid ""
"Use the **search bar** at the top, the **[FAQ](faq.md)** or the "
"**[Glossary](glossaire.md)**. This documentation is public and written to be"
" readable by AI assistants — you can ask your question in plain language."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez la **barre de recherche** en haut, la **[FAQ](faq.md)** ou le "
"**[Glossaire](glossaire.md)**. Cette documentation est publique et conçue "
"pour être lisible par les assistants IA — vous pouvez poser votre question "
"en langage naturel."

